      ],
      "source": "https://www.mywabashvalley.com/news/local-news/clark-county-historical-society-celebrates-60-year-anniversary-with-town-hopping-event/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2026 the society marked 60 years with a self‑guided “Passport to History” tour that visits three historic sites between Marshall and Martinsville.",
